{"id": "21-477-2-10", "zh": "在各个音阶中依次为三、二、四、四，", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-478-2-9", "zh": "三、二、四——共有二十二个微音（suti）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-480-2-9", "zh": "极高的声音叫作 tāra（高音）；不分明而甜美的声音叫作 kala（柔音）；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-481-2-10", "zh": "深沉的声音叫作 manda（低音）；tāra 等三个词用于三性；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-482-2-5", "zh": "细微的柔音叫作 kākalī；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-483-2-4", "zh": "动作等的均匀一致叫作 laya（节拍）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-485-2-10", "zh": "vīṇā 和 vallakī 都指琵琶；有七根弦的叫作 parivādinī；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-486-2-5", "zh": "琵琶的共鸣箱叫作 pokkhara、doṇi；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-487-2-5", "zh": "upavīṇa 指琵琶上的缠束部分。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "21-489-2-7", "zh": "ātata、vitata、ātatavitata、ghana，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-490-2-8", "zh": "还有 susira——这些被称为五种乐器。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-492-2-8", "zh": "所谓 ātata，是指在用皮革蒙起的鼓等乐器当中，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-493-2-9", "zh": "只有一面蒙皮的，如 kumbhathuṇa、daddarika 等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-495-2-9", "zh": "vitata 是两面蒙皮的乐器，如 muraja 等；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-496-2-7", "zh": "ātatavitata 是全身都用皮革包缠的乐器，如 paṇava 等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-498-2-7", "zh": "susira 是笛、螺等吹奏的乐器；ghana 是钹、铙等敲击的乐器；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-499-2-10", "zh": "ātojja、vāditta、vādita、vajja 都称为乐器。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-501-2-9", "zh": "bherī（鼓）也称为 dundubhi；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-502-2-5", "zh": "mudiṅga 即 muraja；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-503-2-8", "zh": "āliṅgya、aṅkya、ūrddhaka 是它的几种类别；", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "21-504-2-6", "zh": "tiṇava 即 ḍiṇḍima（小鼓）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-506-2-9", "zh": "ālambara 即 paṇava（小鼓）；koṇa 是弹奏琵琶等乐器用的拨子；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-507-2-9", "zh": "daddarī、paṭaha、maddala 等都是鼓的类别。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-509-2-8", "zh": "令人喜爱、经揉搓而散发的香气叫作 parimala；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-510-2-10", "zh": "能远远飘散的香气叫作 āmoda；从这里起到 vissa 为止的词用于三性。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-512-2-10", "zh": "好闻的香气称为 iṭṭhagandha、surabhi、sugandha、sugandhi；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-513-2-10", "zh": "恶臭称为 pūtigandhi、duggandha；腥臭称为 vissa、āmagandhi。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-515-2-8", "zh": "番红花（kuṅkuma）、yavanapuppha，还有 tagara，", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-516-2-8", "zh": "以及 turukkha——这四种香料称为 catujjāti。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-518-2-9", "zh": "涩（kasāva，非阴性）、苦、甜、咸，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-519-2-10", "zh": "酸、辣——这是六种味；作“具有该味的”解时用于三性。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-521-2-6", "zh": "phassa 和 phoṭṭhabba 都指所触；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-522-2-5", "zh": "能取境的称为 akkha、indriya（根）；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-523-2-12", "zh": "眼称为 nayana、akkhi、netta、locana、acchi、cakkhu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-525-2-10", "zh": "耳称为 sota、saddaggaha、kaṇṇa、savana、suti；而 natthu、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-526-2-10", "zh": "nāsā、nāsikā、ghāna 指鼻；舌称为 jivhā、rasanā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-528-2-9", "zh": "身体称为 sarīra、vapu、gatta、attabhāva、bondi、viggaha、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-529-2-10", "zh": "deha；kāya 用于阳性；tanu 用于阴性；还有 kaḷevara。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-531-2-10", "zh": "心称为 citta、ceto、mano（非阴性）、viññāṇa、hadaya，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-532-2-12", "zh": "以及 mānasa；慧称为 dhī、paññā、buddhi、medhā、mati、muti、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-534-2-12", "zh": "bhūrī、mantā、paññāṇa、ñāṇa、vijjā、yoni、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-535-2-8", "zh": "paṭibhāna、amoha；而毗婆舍那（vipassanā）、", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-537-2-8", "zh": "正见等是慧的类别；vīmaṃsā 即 vicāraṇā（考察）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-538-2-9", "zh": "sampajañña 即 nepakka（正知）；vedayita 即 vedanā（受）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-540-2-5", "zh": "寻称为 takka、vitakka、saṅkappa、", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-541-2-9", "zh": "appanā、ūhā；寿命称为 āyu、jīvita；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-542-2-9", "zh": "心一境性称为 samatha、avikkhepa、samādhi。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-544-2-10", "zh": "精进称为 ussāha、ātappa、paggāha、vāyāma、parakkama、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-545-2-10", "zh": "padhāna、vīriya、īhā、uyyāma，还有 dhiti（阴性）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-547-2-8", "zh": "精进的四个支分是：只剩下皮和筋，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-548-2-6", "zh": "还有骨头，血肉都干枯了。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-550-2-11", "zh": "极度的精进称为 ussoḷhī；念称为 sati、anussati（阴性）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-551-2-9", "zh": "惭称为 lajjā、hirī，二者同义；愧（ottappa）就是畏惧恶行。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-553-2-10", "zh": "中舍性就是舍，也可以指不苦不乐（受）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-554-2-4", "zh": "作意称为 cittābhoga、manakkāra；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-555-2-5", "zh": "胜解称为 adhimokkha、nicchaya。", "confidence": 70}
